<title>USA: Norwest unit sells $225 mln securities.</title>
<headline>Norwest unit sells $225 mln securities.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwest Asset Securities Corp (NASCOR), in a release received here, said Wednesday it sold about $225 million of mortgage-backed securities backed by 30-year fixed rate mortgage loans through Lehman Brothers and Morgan Stanley &amp; Co.</p>
<p>NASCOR is an affiliate of Norwest Corp's Norwest Mortgage Inc.  It said the series, NASCOR 1997-4, is scheduled to settle on March 27, 1997.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
